/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 59 0 R
/E (Typically, installing mixing impellers within sewage tanks presents challenges due to the highly viscous nature of slurry. Our solution involves a specifically designed mechanism that simplifies installation and removal, catering to the confines of small-diameter sewage tanks. Once submerged to the required depth and set in motion, the innovative blade design refracts efficiently, effectively mixing the slurry.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
